url: 'https://texttechnologylab.github.io/InterView/'
abstract: >-
  InterView is a platform for conducting survey interviews in virtual reality.
  The participant wears a VR headset and sits across from the interviewer's
  avatar; the interviewer works from a web browser. Speech, gaze, posture, hand
  movement, facial expression and the answers are captured on a shared clock.
  This repository contains the deployment stack (Janus, coturn, Ubiq, the
  logging API and the web client) and the platform documentation. The VR client
  is built on Va.Si.Li-Lab.
